  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the equation of the straight line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> which is farthest from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
