  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0092_63e6828549ad.png\" style=\"width:2.17986in;height:1.3in\" /><br />All the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> pass through the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />The line passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; farthest from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to the line joining <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, the slope of the line joining <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;The slope of the required line is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Required line is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
  }
